and lighting to physics simulations. His help with this project (and not only with it) is invaluable, and rest assured, only with his help this animation was able to come out this month. Thank you very much for your help and i look forward to further cooperation! ｡◕‿◕｡\n\nIn the same time, a lot of things happened in our community! We are over 3000 subscribers on Patreon, my twitter and fan pages have been set up, we have met a few other artist, and i've received so many wishes and stories from you, that me and Kitsune cant wait to start working on all of this! ٩(๑•̀ω•́๑)۶\n\nSo, as usual, lets not waste time, because we have too many ideas to make! And at the moment we are still in the process of discussing the details, but it looks like the next animations will be about Raiden ಠ‿↼\n\nSo Thank You once again!!! ♥‿♥\n\nStay healthy and enjoy Mona's new adventure! (づ￣ ³￣)づ ❤️❤️❤️\n\nAnimation Link: https://gofile.io/d/a6UcDv\nAlternative link 1: https://www.filefactory.com/file/1n6djj8ntzni/MonaXSlime1_FULL_S_720WM.mp4\nAlternative link 2: https://workupload.com/file/sGnG3g36uSx\nExtra link by Feng_Yuan: b93701eda2d0f5b997359b5c796c8737#ececbedd35b0216a92eab833d959b841#2074627609#mona X 史莱姆.tar解压码ViciNeko\n链接: https://pan.baidu.com/s/14iJbuRdi145vA1Wa2gjtBQ 提取码: jcuy 解压码ViciNeko\n\nAnd by the way, check out our new social pages!\n\nMain Twitter Page: twitter/vici_neko\nFan Twitter Page: twitter/ViciSupporter\nKitsune Twitter Page: twitter/KitsuneEcchi\n[/section]","duration":540.018,"fav_count":4672,"file":{"width":1280,"height":720,"ext":"webm","url":"https://static1.e621.net/data/74/c0/74c0d39b566b12a9b2cf71640c55a93a.webm"},"preview":{"width":455,"height":256,"url":"https://static1.e621.net/data/preview/74/c0/74c0d39b566b12a9b2cf71640c55a93a.jpg"},"sample":{"has":true,"width":1511,"height":850,"url":"https://static1.e621.net/data/sample/74/c0/74c0d39b566b12a9b2cf71640c55a93a.jpg","alternates":{"original":{"width":1280,"height":720,"url":"https://static1.e621.net/d